<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS4" title="In 4 Experiments ‣ SQAP-VLA: A Synergistic Quantization-Aware Pruning Framework for High-Performance Vision-Language-Action Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.4 </span>Ablation Study</span></a>
